WEBVTT

NOTE F5: single participant. Interviewer requests scales on some steps; one scale is given spontaneously; other measures are free text only. Some interviewer questions must not produce steps (c11, c12). Synthetic.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
<v Interviewer>Can you tell me how you get your repeat prescription?</v>

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:15.000
<v Joan>I take blood pressure tablets, so I need them every month without a gap. That's what matters.</v>

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:27.000
<v Joan>First I log in to the GP surgery app. The password thing is fiddly, it always wants me to change it.</v>

4
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:35.000
<v Interviewer>On a scale of one to five, where one is very easy and five is very hard, how hard is logging in?</v>

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
<v Joan>Oh, a two I suppose. Fiddly, not hard.</v>

6
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:49.000
<v Joan>Then I tick the medicines I need from the list. I do that once a month, regular as clockwork.</v>

7
00:00:49.000 --> 00:01:01.000
<v Joan>Then I choose which pharmacy to send it to. Sometimes the big one, sometimes the little one by the post office, it depends.</v>

8
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:04.000
<v Interviewer>How do you decide?</v>

9
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:12.000
<v Joan>Whichever one I'll be passing. It's not hard, it just depends on my week.</v>

10
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.000
<v Joan>Then I press submit.</v>

11
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:19.000
<v Interviewer>Do you ever ring the surgery instead?</v>

12
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:23.000
<v Joan>No, never. I wouldn't get through.</v>

13
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:30.000
<v Joan>The surgery approves it, that takes two working days.</v>

14
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:38.000
<v Joan>Then the pharmacy makes it up and I get a text when it's ready.</v>

15
00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:52.000
<v Joan>And then I go and collect it. Honestly, that part's a five. The queue is ridiculous, I've stood there forty minutes.</v>

16
00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:57.000
<v Interviewer>How long does the whole thing take, from your side?</v>

17
00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:04.000
<v Joan>The app bit, five minutes. The queue is the killer.</v>
